<https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/heiro-register.owl> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Baines D, Ashley M. Health Economics Institutions and Rules Ontology (HEIRO), version 0.1.0. Intelligent Parameters Ltd; 2026. https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/0.2.0/heiro-register.owl. Licence CC BY 4.0." ;
